Kino plugin "LACartoons". Site behaviour (the series pages, the episode pages and the RPMVid player's API) was read from the live site
and from the CloudStream provider "LACartoonsProvider" in redblacker8/storm-ext (a fork of Stormunblessed/storm-ext); no code was
copied from it. The ok.ru extractor, the packer reader and the request helper are adapted from the Kino plugin "Latino"
(xuper-plugin/kino-plugin-latino, Apache-2.0), by the same author.
